Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.13,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The alert said:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:02.84,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}avoid anyone\Nacting {\1c&H7A8AFF&}strangely{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.14,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}It was Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:06.44,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Three blocks\Nto get Mia home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:07.69,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Half the street
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.30,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}was dressed as {\1c&H7A8AFF&}zombies{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.50,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Some of them\Nweren't pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:14.01,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Then the screaming\Ndidn't stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.91,S1_Chip,,0,0,742,,{\3c&HE08EB4&\4c&HE08EB4&}MIA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.91,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Which ones are {\1c&H47C2FF&}real{\1c&HFFFFFF&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.46,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Two ways home:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:19.27,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}the bright,\Ncrowded street…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.41,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}…or the empty,\N{\1c&H7A8AFF&}dark{\1c&HFFFFFF&} alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.74,N1_LaneB,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}In the dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.81,N1_LaneB,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}you can't see\Nwhat's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.47,N1_LaneB,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Kai took the {\1c&H47C2FF&}light{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.02,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}It was cold enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.62,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}to see your {\1c&H47C2FF&}breath{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.27,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Every costume around him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:32.18,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}was breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.52,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Except one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:36.25,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The living {\1c&H47C2FF&}breathe{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:39.61,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}On a cold night,\Nyou can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:41.59,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Puff. Puff. Puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:42.37,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}{\1c&H7A8AFF&}Nothing{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.87,S1_Chip,,0,0,742,,{\3c&HB6B39F&\4c&HB6B39F&}GUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.87,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Stay away from Mr. Pell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.43,0:00:47.33,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The scariest\Ncostume was breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:49.07,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The friendliest\Nface {\1c&H7A8AFF&}wasn't{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:53.18,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}They can push.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.33,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}They can't turn\Na {\1c&H47C2FF&}handle{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:57.64,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Two breaths\Non the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:58.63,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Both {\1c&H47C2FF&}alive{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
